%T InternVL3: Exploring Advanced Training and Test-Time Recipes for Open-Source Multimodal Models
%A Jinguo Zhu
%A Weiyun Wang
%A Zhe Chen
%A Zhaoyang Liu
%A Shenglong Ye
%A Lixin Gu
%A Yuchen Duan
