%T Research on the Analysis and Reasoning Model of Enterprise Bidding Environment of Energy Project Digital Procurement Based on HMM
%A Taiguang Gao
%A Qing-qing Wang
%A Youjian Wang
%D 2023
%J 2022 First International Conference on Cyber-Energy Systems and Intelligent Energy (ICCSIE)
%X he smarter energy industry will become an important economic growth point, Digital procurement of energy projects is an essential link in the development of the energy industry, and it is necessary to realize the supervision of enterprise bidding environment through the operating environment of digital procurement platform. Based on the relationship between the similarity of bidding quotations and the collusion behavior of enterprises, this paper proposes an analysis and reasoning model of the enterprise bidding environment based on the Hidden Markov Model (HMM). The model is trained using historical data from the procurement of energy projects to enhance analysis and judgment capabilities of the proposed model’s bidding environment, and an early warning system is proposed when the collusion behavior of enterprises is discovered to realize the supervision of the bidding environment of digital procurement enterprises of energy projects. Finally, the validity of the proposed model is verified by numerical simulation.
